    "created_at": "2021-09-01T18:25:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-01T18:25:02Z",
    "body": "Reopening this rather than file a new issue, since I imagine the context is helpful. \r\n\r\nI still think having having doc authors do a self-analysis of security issues is helpful.  I'm also not sure what that will look like, which is part of why we point back at the doc authors for the first pass.\r\n\r\nYou might find [RFC3552 Section 5](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3552#section-5) helpful.  I'm not sure how much the usual [TAG/PING questionnaire ](https://w3ctag.github.io/security-questionnaire/)will help in this case, but it's worth looking through.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
